                   preprocessor removes it. The directive must sit INSIDE the @if body: Razor emits a
                   markup-region #if as literal text, so fencing the @if from the outside does nothing
                   (measured — the CS0117 survived). Same placement as the sibling call-sites in
                   NavMenu.razor, Data/Services/ServiceCatalog.cs and Pages/Governance.razor. *@
